# HR360 Backend Traceability

**Project:** HR360 – Human Resource Management & Analytics System
**Document ID:** HR360-BE-006
**Version:** 1.0
**Status:** Draft for Review
**Date:** 20 September 2026
**Prepared By:** Nida Khan
**Product Owner:** HR Business Stakeholder

## 1. Purpose

This document provides traceability between HR360 business requirements, functional requirements, user stories, APIs, database areas, and backend implementation.

## 2. Traceability Model

```text
BRD
 |
 v
FRD
 |
 v
User Story
 |
 v
Acceptance Criteria
 |
 v
API
 |
 v
Database
 |
 v
Test / UAT
```

